msgstr "Lettertype Awesome aanwezig al bij @path. Geen download vereist."

msgid "Drush was unable to download the Font Awesome library from @remote."
msgstr "Drush is niet in staat om de bibliotheek Font Awesome te downloaden van @remote."

msgid "Error: unable to download Fontawesome library from @remote"
msgstr "Fout: Fontawesome-bibliotheek kan niet worden gedownload van @remote"

